- id: Q-21
  severity: medium
  status: open (reframed by SEMANTICS.md: the registry locks ARE the demonstranda; anchoring is a descriptor of their worth, not a gate; six wrappers remain un-anchored to Mathlib names because Mathlib has none)
  title: registry locks are locks on a name; the content lives in one custom constant
  detail: >
    Import found each clay_prize_* type is a single custom Prop
